        {
            "id": 6668916,
            "title": "〈焦點股〉台股狂殺2400點 光通訊一片哀號超過10檔亮燈跌停",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>AI大廠Anthropic(ANT-US)周四掛牌首日大漲逾17%，可惜未能帶動美國上揚，在AI題材信心潰散下，拖累台股今(20)日續挫，儘管金管會祭出「限空令2.0版」，盤中仍重挫2,400點。</p></section><p></p><div class=\"c1hvmcli\"><figure><div class=\"iirgi4a\"><img alt=\"cover image of news article\" src=\"https://cimg.cnyes.cool/prod/news/6668916/l/230395850ae4fb19ac161c7a2b5aef8f.jpg\"/></div><figcaption class=\"c1gcnfq1\">台股狂殺2400點，光通訊一片哀號超過10檔亮燈跌停。 (圖：shutterstock)</figcaption></figure></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>盤面上，與AI高度相關的光通訊股，一片慘綠，包括聯亞(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:3081:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/3081\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">3081-TW</a>)、光聖(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6442:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6442\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6442-TW</a>)、波若威(3163TW)等超過10檔以上也亮燈跌停。<br/>\n<br/>\n盤面上，台廠光通訊股王聯亞開盤隨即跳空觸及跌停價1,365元，盤中成交量縮減至400張以下，統計聯亞從高點11月11日的2,215元，僅7個交易日就重挫850點，跌幅逾4成。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>其他包括光聖、波若威、華星光(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:4979:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/4979\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">4979-TW</a>)、聯鈞(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:3450:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/3450\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">3450-TW</a>)、統新(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6426:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6426\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6426-TW</a>)、光環(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:3234:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/3234\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">3234-TW</a>)、東典光電(6588 TW)、眾達-KY(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:4977:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/4977\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">4977-TW</a>)、上詮(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:3363:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/3363\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">3363-TW</a>)、前鼎(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:4908:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/4908\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">4908-TW</a>)。</p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>以及三五族光通訊廠環宇-KY(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:4991:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/4991\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">4991-TW</a>)、IET-KY(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:4971:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/4971\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">4971-TW</a>)、全新(2455 -TW)等超過10檔以上，開盤後宛如大怒神，迅速亮燈跌停板。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\">\n</section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>法人指出，限空令雖有助於挹注空方壓力，加上國安基金進場下，有望靜待止穩訊號，但從市場投資人信心趨向潰散下，仍待外資期現貨賣壓趨緩下，加上電子權值股台積電(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2330:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2330\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2330-TW</a>)、聯發科(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:2454:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/2454\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">2454-TW</a>)等止穩後，台股才有機會待指數打出第二隻腳後及站回年線反轉。</p></section></main>",
